  "worked_solution": "The general solution to our equation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x+{50}^{\u2218} & ={135}^{\u2218}+{360}^{\u2218}\\cdot n, & \\, & \\, & x+{50}^{\u2218} & ={225}^{\u2218}+{360}^{\u2218}\\cdot n.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSolving the two equations above for $x,$ we get:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={135}^{\u2218}-{50}^{\u2218}+{360}^{\u2218}\\cdot n & \\, & \\, & x & ={225}^{\u2218}-{50}^{\u2218}+{360}^{\u2218}\\cdot n \\\\ x & ={85}^{\u2218}+{360}^{\u2218}\\cdot n & \\, & \\, & x & ={175}^{\u2218}+{360}^{\u2218}\\cdot n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have that $a={85}^{\u2218}.$",
